<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 3.78 points off FTSE, May 6.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 3.78 points off FTSE, May 6.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE-100 stocks will trade ex-dividend on May 6 and analysts estimate this will take 3.78 points off the index that day.</p>
<p>					   DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>					   (PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>	COMPANY			  Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>    * BG			     8.10  10.125   2.622</p>
<p>    * Bank of Scotland	   5.31   6.637   0.465</p>
<p>    * Smith &amp; Nephew	     3.71   4.638   0.297</p>
<p>    * Williams Holdings	  9.25  11.563   0.393</p>
<p>	 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
